# =============================================================================
# THE UNIVERSE — .env.production
# =============================================================================
# You never write this file. Terraform renders it, complete, from your
# terraform.tfvars (the ONE file you fill — see infra/digitalocean/):
#
#   cd infra/digitalocean            # or infra/aws
#   terraform apply
#   terraform output -raw env_production > ../../.env.production
#
# Deploy: unoverse deploy && unoverse deploy db && unoverse deploy test
#
# ⚠️  The rendered file IS your universe's secrets. It includes the MASTER KEY
# (CREDENTIAL_ENCRYPTION_KEY) that locks every credential users save in the
# platform — if it's lost, no backup can bring them back. Never commit it.
# Keep a safe copy alongside your database backups.
#
# To change any value: edit terraform.tfvars and re-render. Never hand-edit.
